# Pages rules. On a phone with the app, trip, stop and plan links open the app through the files in
# .well-known before these rules run. In a browser: a shared trip goes to the live trip page on the API
# (302, the share id kept, done by functions/trip/[id].js); stop and plan links show the Open in the app page (200 keeps the address).
/download/  /  301
/download   /  301
/trip       /open/  200
/trip/      /open/  200
/stop/*     /open/  200
/plan       /open/  200
/plan/*     /open/  200
/open/*     /open/  200
